# Sumala Sentry manifested face down is a 2/2 with no abilities (CR 708.2a), so entering face down triggers nothing; turned face up
# (CR 701.40b) it is "a face-down permanent you control ... turned face up" and its trigger puts a counter on it and a counter on
# this creature - the same permanent: two +1/+1 counters, a 3/5 (1/3 plus two).
#
# Turn 1: Black Lotus pays for Hauntwoods Shrieker. Turn 3 the Shrieker attacks and manifests the Sentry (Arrange puts it first) with
# Lightning Bolt into the graveyard; Mox Emerald and Mox Pearl pay {G}{W} to turn it face up.

